WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.000
DAVA NEWMAN: Hello,
I'm Dava Newman.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.330
And when I served as NASA
Deputy Administrator--

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.620
that's the number two--

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:26.130
I became very familiar with
our Earth-observing satellites,

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.300
which tell us about the vital
signs of our planet, which

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.420
I call Spaceship
Earth, eyes on Earth

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.490
from this global perspective.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.240
I saw warming
temperatures, melting ice,

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.820
intensifying natural disasters.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.540
Climate change is real.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.640
And if we're going to solve
climate change, the moon

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:52.440
shot of our generation,
we need everyone on board.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.200
That's why with the support
of the MIT Portugal Program,

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.460
my partners and I
started EarthDNA, data

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.460
into action for the Earth.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.790
We want to unite the whole
world in creating a sustainable

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.430
relationship between
humans and nature,

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:10.500
and we're so happy
to have you with us.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.360
You'll be our
astronauts traveling

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.850
to places we could never
reach by ourselves,

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:16.500
and we'll be your
mission control,

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.510
providing you with
the tools and guidance

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:21.990
you need to make an impact
at the schools around you.

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:24.570
You'll teach students,
students will teach families,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.370
and families will demand action.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:29.880
With your help, we can
reach a destination,

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:32.610
a world that works
for 100% of humanity

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.500
without ecological offense.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:35.970
We're ready for
liftoff, and we're

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:38.690
thrilled to have you on
board, so let's get started.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:44.300
3, 2, 1, launch.

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:47.650
[MUSIC PLAYING]

